{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39649246",
      "title": "Deriving & Outputting Data Based on State",
      "sourceHash": "32a51db1802ec43ce612819389b063c8045248ffe25b63940a3ec6aee54f2ec6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.33,
          "end": 3.75,
          "en": "So let's now use this state feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.75,
          "end": 6.66,
          "en": "to output more meaningful content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.66,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "than just these button identifiers here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 15.26,
          "en": "And for that, attached you find an updated data.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "which now also includes this examples constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 20.823,
          "en": "that gets exported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.66,
          "end": 24.9,
          "en": "And this constant here simply holds an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.9,
          "end": 27.99,
          "en": "with keys that match these identifiers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.99,
          "end": 31.26,
          "en": "that are passed upon these button clicks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 34.98,
          "en": "So state, props, JSX, and components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.98,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "And then for those identifiers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 40.8,
          "en": "we find nested JavaScript objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.8,
          "end": 45.12,
          "en": "which each have a title, description, and code property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.12,
          "end": 49.383,
          "en": "which is that actual data that should be output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 52.53,
          "en": "For that, for styling purposes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 54.73,
          "en": "I'll first of all add a div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 58.833,
          "en": "with an ID of tab-content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.36,
          "end": 64.95,
          "en": "And inside of that div, I want to have an H3 element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.95,
          "end": 68.94,
          "en": "which should output the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.94,
          "end": 70.32,
          "en": "Then below that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.32,
          "end": 73.28999999999999,
          "en": "a paragraph which should output the description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.28999999999999,
          "end": 78.28999999999999,
          "en": "And below that, a pre tag with a nested code element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.3,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "which should output that code example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 83.703,
          "en": "stored in that code property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.72,
          "end": 86.64,
          "en": "So for that, we'll need to import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.64,
          "end": 91.5,
          "en": "this examples constant here into the app.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.5,
          "end": 94.563,
          "en": "because that's where we're managing this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.52000000000001,
          "end": 100.52000000000001,
          "en": "So here, I'll import from ./data.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.797,
          "end": 105.797,
          "en": "and I'll import examples, this examples constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.22,
          "en": "And now we want to dive into this examples constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.22,
          "end": 113.97,
          "en": "and use the data for the button that was clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 117.663,
          "en": "So for the components, JSX, props button, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 119.00999999999999,
          "end": 121.32,
          "en": "And doing that is pretty simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.32,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "Since we're storing these identifiers in our state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 128.97,
          "en": "we can just use this state to dynamically access the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 128.97,
          "end": 131.91,
          "en": "for these different properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.91,
          "end": 134.37,
          "en": "Of course, this only works if these property names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.37,
          "end": 137.01,
          "en": "are exactly equal to your identifiers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 137.01,
          "end": 139.863,
          "en": "so you should double check that this is the case for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 143.1,
          "en": "So that these identifiers here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 143.1,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "which we're setting based on these button clicks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 149.463,
          "en": "match the identifiers in this examples object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 151.2,
          "end": 155.52,
          "en": "But with that, we can then go down here, and for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 155.52,
          "end": 159.36,
          "en": "set the H3 element to some dynamic content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 159.36,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "where we access this examples constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 165.763,
          "en": "And then we use square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 165.763,
          "end": 167.94,
          "en": "to dynamically access a property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 167.94,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "which also is some standard JavaScript syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 175.2,
          "en": "And the name of the property we want to access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 175.2,
          "end": 179.073,
          "en": "will be stored in this selected topic state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 180.54,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "And with that, we'll access one of these objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 185.1,
          "en": "And then I'm interested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 188.01,
          "en": "in the title here in this H3 element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 188.01,
          "end": 192.843,
          "en": "So we should access .title on that nested object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 194.34,
          "end": 196.63,
          "en": "And we can repeat this approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 198.18,
          "end": 200.4,
          "en": "for the paragraph element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 200.4,
          "end": 203.31,
          "en": "And here, it's the description property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 203.31,
          "end": 205.41,
          "en": "that should be accessed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 205.41,
          "end": 210.41,
          "en": "And for the code here, it's the code property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 212.82,
          "end": 215.46,
          "en": "And with that, we're accessing different data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 215.46,
          "end": 217.473,
          "en": "based on which button is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 221.79,
          "en": "Now of course, you'll note that if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 221.79,
          "end": 225.78,
          "en": "I now get an error here in the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 225.78,
          "end": 230.04,
          "en": "because initially when this page first loads,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 230.04,
          "end": 232.893,
          "en": "we're not selecting a valid element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 233.97,
          "end": 236.49,
          "en": "Instead, initially, our initial state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 236.49,
          "end": 238.953,
          "en": "is this please click a button text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 244.62,
          "en": "And this is therefore what this program tries to find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 244.62,
          "end": 247.803,
          "en": "as a property name in this examples object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 251.1,
          "en": "And of course there is no property called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 251.1,
          "end": 252.423,
          "en": "please click a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 253.416,
          "end": 254.43,
          "en": "So this doesn't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 254.43,
          "end": 257.07,
          "en": "And therefore to work around that, for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 257.07,
          "end": 259.62,
          "en": "I'll set this initial state to components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 262.173,
          "en": "so that this is selected initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 264.12,
          "end": 266.97,
          "en": "With that, if I reload, the error is gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 266.97,
          "end": 270.663,
          "en": "and we see this components information here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 271.62,
          "end": 273.647,
          "en": "And if I now click JSX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 273.647,
          "end": 276.99,
          "en": "this switches to the JSX information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 276.99,
          "end": 280.323,
          "en": "And the same is the case for props and state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 281.46,
          "end": 286.38,
          "en": "So this now works and allows us to view different content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 286.38,
          "end": 288.453,
          "en": "based on which button was pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}